================================================================================
FST4 — SAMPLE DATA SETS: ORIGIN, ATTRIBUTION AND TERMS
================================================================================

The data sets in this directory are third-party research data. They are NOT
covered by the FST4 copyright and licence (README.md, LICENSE): each one carries
its own terms, reproduced below and repeated in each data file's own header
(exception: the .csv files — the CSV format has no comment syntax, so they
carry no in-file header and this file is their attribution record).

Every file here is referenced by at least one exemplar demo, demos/*.cfg parity
config, or golden test scenario; nothing is bundled that the toolbox does not
actually use.

If you redistribute FST4, this file and the data file headers must travel with
it.

