  data/wdbc_30.trn
  data/wdbc_30.csv
    Wolberg, W., Mangasarian, O., Street, N., & Street, W. (1993). Breast
    Cancer Wisconsin (Diagnostic) [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C5DW2B.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    MODIFIED: converted to FST TRN format (569 samples, 30 features, 2
    classes). One row that an earlier TRN conversion had duplicated in error
    was removed. wdbc_30.csv is a CSV conversion of the same file (identical
    values and sample order; class labels benign/malignant), included so the
    demos can exercise the CSV reader.

  data/ionosphere.arff
    Sigillito, V., Wing, S., Hutton, L., & Baker, K. (1989). Ionosphere
    [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C5W01B.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    MODIFIED: supplied in ARFF form.

  data/mushroom_125.trn
    Mushroom [Dataset]. (1981). UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C5959T.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    UCI records no named creator for this data set; its abstract states the
    data is drawn from an Audubon Society field guide to North American
    mushrooms (1981).
    MODIFIED: converted to FST TRN format and BINARIZED — the original 22
    categorical attributes are expanded into 125 binary features
    (8124 samples, 2 classes).

  data/optdigits_64.trn
    Alpaydin, E. & Kaynak, C. (1998). Optical Recognition of Handwritten
    Digits [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C50P49.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    MODIFIED: converted to FST TRN format, with the original training and test
    parts COMBINED into a single set (5620 samples, 64 features, 10 classes).

  data/spambase_57.trn
  data/spambase_57.csv
    Hopkins, M., Reeber, E., Forman, G., & Suermondt, J. (1999). Spambase
    [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C53G6X.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    MODIFIED: converted to FST TRN format (4601 samples, 57 features,
    2 classes). spambase_57.csv is a CSV conversion of the same file
    (identical values and sample order; class labels spam/nonspam), included
    so the demos can exercise the CSV reader.

  data/waveform_40.trn
  data/waveform_40.arff
    Breiman, L. & Stone, C. (1984). Waveform Database Generator (Version 2)
    [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C56014.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    MODIFIED: Version 2 of the generated database (40 features, 5000 samples,
    3 classes), supplied twice — converted to FST TRN format, and in ARFF
    form (waveform_40.arff, named waveform-5000.arff before FST4 4.2; the
    TRN is the class-major reordering of the same rows). NOTE: the
    descriptive comment block inherited inside the ARFF file describes
    Version 1 (21 attributes); the data itself is Version 2.

  data/sonar_60.trn
  data/sonar_60.arff
  data/sonar_60_missing_data.trn
    Sejnowski, T. & Gorman, R. (1988). Connectionist Bench (Sonar, Mines vs.
    Rocks) [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C5T01Q.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    MODIFIED: 208 samples, 60 features, 2 classes; converted to FST TRN format
    and supplied in ARFF form (sonar_60.arff, named sonar.arff before FST4
    4.2). The historical TRN conversion declared a wrong class split (103
    rocks / 105 mines); FST4 4.2 corrected both TRN variants to the official
    UCI split (97 rocks / 111 mines), matching the ARFF, which was always
    correct. sonar_60_missing_data.trn is a FURTHER MODIFIED
    variant created for FST's missing-value demonstrations, in which 30% of the
    values are marked as missing (encoded as the integer value 5).

  data/madelon_train_nips_500.trn
    Guyon, I. (2004). Madelon [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
    https://doi.org/10.24432/C5602H.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    Originally prepared for the NIPS 2003 Feature Selection Challenge. The data
    is entirely SYNTHETIC — generated, with no real-world source.
    MODIFIED: the TRAINING part only (2000 samples, 500 features, 2 classes),
    converted to FST TRN format.

  data/gisette_valid_nips_5000.trn
    Guyon, I., Gunn, S., Ben-Hur, A., & Dror, G. (2004). Gisette [Dataset].
    UCI Machine Learning Repository. https://doi.org/10.24432/C5HP5B.
    Licence: CC BY 4.0.
    Originally prepared for the NIPS 2003 Feature Selection Challenge, and
    constructed from the MNIST handwritten digit database (the confusable
    digits 4 and 9) of Y. LeCun, C. Cortes and C. Burges. Roughly half of the
    5000 features are synthetic distractor probes.
    MODIFIED: the VALIDATION part only (1000 samples, 5000 features,
    2 classes), converted to FST TRN format.

